{"op": "create:script", "name": "ADT_scripts", "type": "folder"}
{"op": "create:script", "name": "UTL_LeerExcelJSON_sp", "folder": "ADT_scripts", "hidden": false, "runWithFullAccess": false, "body": [{"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "▼ ========================================================================== ▼"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "   Propósito:      Seleccionar y leer un XLSX como JSON sin crear ni modificar registros."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "   Llamado desde:  Menú Guiones o un guion que recoge Get ( ScriptResult ). Área UTL: utilidades."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "   Entorno:        FileMaker Pro 19.5+ Mac/Windows y BaseElements; cualquier presentación."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "   Parámetros (JSON): Opcional {ruta: texto}; ruta nativa absoluta. Sin ruta abre selector."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "   Devuelve:       {errorCode,message,data:{hojas:[{nombre,columnas,filas}]}} y $$_EXCEL.RESULTADO_JSON."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "UTL_LeerExcelJSON_sp: sin parámetro abre selector. Parámetro JSON opcional: {ruta: ruta absoluta nativa al XLSX}."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Resultado: {errorCode:0,message:vacio,data:{hojas:[{nombre,columnas:{A:encabezado},filas:[{numero,valores:{A:texto},tipos:{A:tipoOpenXML},estilos:{A:indice},formulas:{A:formula}}]}]}}."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Primera fila con contenido de cada hoja = cabecera. Claves de columna A,B,...; faltantes se omiten; valores almacenados como texto; fechas numéricas sin convertir; fórmulas sin recalcular, se usa caché. Hojas de gráficos se omiten."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Recoger Get ( ScriptResult ) inmediatamente tras Perform Script. También reemplaza $$_EXCEL.RESULTADO_JSON al inicio/final, incluso ante cancelación (errorCode=1) o error; no usar datos si errorCode<>0."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "No crea/modifica registros ni cambia presentación. Descomprime en subcarpeta temporal UUID y la elimina al finalizar."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Las llamadas de BaseElements son Evaluate de código fijo, resuelto en el cliente. No requiere plugin en el CLI para almacenar el guion."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "▲ ========================================================================== ▲"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#"}, {"stepID": 85, "step": "Allow User Abort", "on": false}, {"stepID": 86, "step": "Set Error Capture", "on": true}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Global inicializada y reemplazada aquí en cada ejecución, incluidos errores/cancelación. Solo memoria de la sesión."}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$$_EXCEL.RESULTADO_JSON", "value": "\"\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_hojas", "value": "\"[]\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_temporal", "value": "\"\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_parametro", "value": "Get ( ScriptParameter )"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Las llamadas BE se evalúan como expresiones fijas para resolver el plugin en el cliente. No se concatena contenido del Excel como código."}, {"stepID": 71, "step": "Loop", "flush": "always"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "EvaluationError ( Evaluate ( \"BE_Version\" ) ) <> 0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "113"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"BaseElements no está instalado o activado en este equipo.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "not IsEmpty ( $_parametro )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "Left ( JSONFormatElements ( $_parametro ) ; 1 ) <> \"{\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "1700"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"El parámetro debe ser un objeto JSON con ruta opcional.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_ruta", "value": "JSONGetElement ( $_parametro ; \"ruta\" )"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_ruta )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_ruta", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileSelectDialog ( \\\"Seleccione un archivo Excel .xlsx\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_ruta ) or $_error = 1"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "1"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"Selección cancelada.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudo seleccionar el archivo.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "Lower ( Right ( $_ruta ; 5 ) ) <> \".xlsx\" or ValueCount ( $_ruta ) <> 1"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "10001"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"Seleccione un único archivo .xlsx sin contraseña. El formato .xls no es compatible.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_temporal", "value": "ConvertFromFileMakerPath ( \"file:\" & Get ( TemporaryPath ) & \"FMExcel_\" & Get ( UUID ) & \"/\" ; Case ( Get ( SystemPlatform ) = -2 ; WinPath ; PosixPath ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_temporal ) or $_temporal = \"?\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_temporal", "value": "\"\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "10002"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudo obtener la carpeta temporal del cliente.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_operacion", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FolderCreate ( $_temporal )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudo crear la carpeta temporal.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "20/11/2026: leer el XLSX binario mediante BE_FileImport (ruta Unicode) antes de BE_Unzip. Evita la apertura estrecha UTF-8/ANSI de UnZipFile en Windows. No renombra ni modifica el archivo original."}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_archivoBinario", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileImport ( $_ruta )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0 or IsEmpty ( $_archivoBinario )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Case ( $_error ; $_error ; 10012 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudo leer el XLSX como archivo binario. Compruebe la ruta y los permisos.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_operacion", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_Unzip ( $_archivoBinario ; $_temporal )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudo descomprimir el XLSX. Compruebe que existe y no está cifrado.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_libro", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileReadText ( $_temporal & \\\"xl/workbook.xml\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0 or IsEmpty ( $_libro )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Case ( $_error ; $_error ; 10003 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se encuentra un libro XLSX válido (xl/workbook.xml).\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_relaciones", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileReadText ( $_temporal & \\\"xl/_rels/workbook.xml.rels\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0 or IsEmpty ( $_relaciones )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Case ( $_error ; $_error ; 10003 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pueden resolver las hojas del libro.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_textos", "value": "\"\""}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileExists ( $_temporal & \\\"xl/sharedStrings.xml\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_textos", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileReadText ( $_temporal & \\\"xl/sharedStrings.xml\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudieron leer los textos compartidos.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"count(/*[local-name()='workbook']/*[local-name()='sheets']/*[local-name()='sheet'])\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_numeroHojas", "value": "Let ( [ bruto = Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_libro ; $_xpath )\" ) ; numero = JSONGetElement ( \"[\" & bruto & \"]\" ; 0 ) ; $_error = Case ( Left ( numero ; 1 ) = \"?\" or IsEmpty ( numero ) ; 10010 ; $_error ) ] ; Case ( $_error ; 0 ; numero ) )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( $_error ; $_error ; errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0 or GetAsNumber ( $_numeroHojas ) < 1"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Case ( $_error ; $_error ; 10004 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"El libro no contiene hojas legibles.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_inicio", "value": "Get ( CurrentTimeStamp )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_indiceHoja", "value": "1"}, {"stepID": 71, "step": "Loop", "flush": "always"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "Let ( $_error = Case ( Get ( CurrentTimeStamp ) - $_inicio > 30 ; 10011 ; $_error ) ; $_indiceHoja > $_numeroHojas or $_error <> 0 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_baseHoja", "value": "\"/*[local-name()='workbook']/*[local-name()='sheets']/*[local-name()='sheet'][\" & $_indiceHoja & \"]\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"string(\" & $_baseHoja & \"/@name)\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_nombreHoja", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_libro ; $_xpath )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"string(\" & $_baseHoja & \"/@*[local-name()='id'])\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_idHoja", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_libro ; $_xpath )\" )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_idHoja ) or Filter ( $_idHoja ; \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789_-\" ) <> $_idHoja"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "10005"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"Identificador de hoja no compatible.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_baseRelacion", "value": "\"/*[local-name()='Relationships']/*[local-name()='Relationship'][@Id='\" & $_idHoja & \"']\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"string(\" & $_baseRelacion & \"/@Type)\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_tipoHoja", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_relaciones ; $_xpath )\" )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "Right ( $_tipoHoja ; 10 ) = \"/worksheet\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"string(\" & $_baseRelacion & \"/@Target)\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_destino", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_relaciones ; $_xpath )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"string(\" & $_baseRelacion & \"/@TargetMode)\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_modo", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_relaciones ; $_xpath )\" )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_destino ) or $_modo = \"External\" or PatternCount ( $_destino ; \"..\" ) or PatternCount ( $_destino ; \":\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "10006"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"Ruta de hoja externa o no compatible.\""}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_archivoHoja", "value": "$_temporal & Case ( Left ( $_destino ; 1 ) = \"/\" ; Middle ( $_destino ; 2 ; Length ( $_destino ) ) ; \"xl/\" & $_destino )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xmlHoja", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_FileReadText ( $_archivoHoja )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_error <> 0 or IsEmpty ( $_xmlHoja )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Case ( $_error ; $_error ; 10007 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"No se pudo leer la hoja: \" & $_nombreHoja"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Primera fila con contenido = encabezados. Se omiten filas sin celdas con valor/fórmula. Claves A,B,... conservan columnas vacías o duplicadas."}, {"stepID": 89, "step": "#", "text": "Normalizar solo la copia en memoria: los atributos de formato x14ac/xr de Excel heredan namespaces que BE_XPath no incluye al extraer una fila. Se conservan contenido y atributos de datos sin prefijo; no se altera el XLSX."}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xsltDatos", "value": "\"<xsl:stylesheet version='1.0' xmlns:xsl='http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Transform'><xsl:output method='xml' encoding='UTF-8' omit-xml-declaration='yes'/><xsl:template match='*'><xsl:element name='{local-name()}'><xsl:apply-templates select='@*[namespace-uri() = &quot;&quot;] | node()'/></xsl:element></xsl:template><xsl:template match='@* | text()'><xsl:copy/></xsl:template><xsl:template match='comment() | processing-instruction()'/></xsl:stylesheet>\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xmlHoja", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XSLT_ApplyInMemory ( $_xmlHoja ; $_xsltDatos )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_baseFilas", "value": "\"/*[local-name()='worksheet']/*[local-name()='sheetData']/*[local-name()='row'][*[local-name()='c']/*[local-name()='v' or local-name()='is' or local-name()='f']]\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"count(\" & $_baseFilas & \")\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_numeroFilas", "value": "Let ( [ bruto = Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlHoja ; $_xpath )\" ) ; numero = JSONGetElement ( \"[\" & bruto & \"]\" ; 0 ) ; $_error = Case ( Left ( numero ; 1 ) = \"?\" or IsEmpty ( numero ) ; 10010 ; $_error ) ] ; Case ( $_error ; 0 ; numero ) )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( $_error ; $_error ; errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "$_error <> 0"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_columnas", "value": "\"{}\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_filas", "value": "\"[]\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_indiceFila", "value": "1"}, {"stepID": 71, "step": "Loop", "flush": "always"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "Let ( $_error = Case ( Get ( CurrentTimeStamp ) - $_inicio > 30 ; 10011 ; $_error ) ; $_indiceFila > $_numeroFilas or $_error <> 0 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "$_baseFilas & \"[\" & $_indiceFila & \"]\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xmlFila", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlHoja ; $_xpath ; \\\"\\\" ; 0 )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_numeroFila", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlFila ; \\\"string(/*/@r)\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_numeroCeldas", "value": "Let ( [ bruto = Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlFila ; \\\"count(/*/*[local-name()='c'])\\\" )\" ) ; numero = JSONGetElement ( \"[\" & bruto & \"]\" ; 0 ) ; $_error = Case ( Left ( numero ; 1 ) = \"?\" or IsEmpty ( numero ) ; 10010 ; $_error ) ] ; Case ( $_error ; 0 ; numero ) )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_fila", "value": "JSONSetElement ( \"{}\" ; [ \"numero\" ; $_numeroFila ; JSONNumber ] ; [ \"valores\" ; \"{}\" ; JSONObject ] ; [ \"tipos\" ; \"{}\" ; JSONObject ] ; [ \"estilos\" ; \"{}\" ; JSONObject ] ; [ \"formulas\" ; \"{}\" ; JSONObject ] )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_indiceCelda", "value": "1"}, {"stepID": 71, "step": "Loop", "flush": "always"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "Let ( $_error = Case ( Get ( CurrentTimeStamp ) - $_inicio > 30 ; 10011 ; $_error ) ; $_indiceCelda > $_numeroCeldas or $_error <> 0 )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xpath", "value": "\"/*/*[local-name()='c'][\" & $_indiceCelda & \"]\""}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_xmlCelda", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlFila ; $_xpath ; \\\"\\\" ; 0 )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_referencia", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlCelda ; \\\"string(/*/@r)\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_columna", "value": "Filter ( $_referencia ; \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\" )"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_columna )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "10008"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_mensaje", "value": "\"Celda sin referencia de columna válida en \" & $_nombreHoja"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "1"}, {"stepID": 70, "step": "End If"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_tipo", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlCelda ; \\\"string(/*/@t)\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_estilo", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlCelda ; \\\"string(/*/@s)\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_formula", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlCelda ; \\\"string(/*/*[local-name()='f'])\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_valor", "value": "Evaluate ( \"BE_XPath ( $_xmlCelda ; \\\"string(/*/*[local-name()='v'])\\\" )\" )"}, {"stepID": 141, "step": "Set Variable", "name": "$_error", "value": "Let ( errorFM = Get ( LastError ) ; Case ( errorFM ; errorFM ; Evaluate ( \"BE_GetLastError\" ) ) )"}, {"stepID": 72, "step": "Exit Loop If", "condition": "$_error <> 0"}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_tipo = \"s\" or $_tipo = \"inlineStr\""}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "$_tipo = \"s\""}, {"stepID": 68, "step": "If", "condition": "IsEmpty ( $_textos ) or IsEmpty ( $_valor ) or Filter ( $_valor ; \"0123456789\" ) <